<p>Hai Salaam Us Pe Jo Qaidi Bhi Hai Bemaar Bhi Hai<br />
Paao'n Me Aable Hain Aabloun Me qaar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Kehta Tha Touq-E Giraan Tu Hai Mere Hisse Me<br />
Warna Is Fouj Me Khanjar Bhi Hai Talwaar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Poochaa Ek Shaqs Ne Shabbir Tera Kaun Hai<br />
Roke Farmaane Lage Baba Bhi Hai Sardaar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Pahonche Nazdeek Jo Laashe Ke Sakina Ne Kaha<br />
Yeh Mere Baba Ka Bhaai Bhi Hai Alamdaar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Pahonche Nazdeek Jo Koofe Ke Toh Boli Zainab<br />
Sar Bhi Uriyaan Hai, Balwaa Bhi Hai Bazaar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Dum Ruk Jaata Hai Aur Sar Bhi Jhuk Jaata Hai<br />
Touq Yeh Tangh Nihaayat Bhi Hai Garaa'n baar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Gar Che Beemaar Hoo'n Par Zor-E Imaamat Ke Sabab<br />
Oontt Bhi Khenchta Hoo'n Taaqath-E Raftaar Bhi Hai<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Jab Inhe Shimr Nazar Aata Toh Ro Ro Kehte<br />
Yeh Sitamgar Bhi Hai Qaatil Bhi Hai Khoonkhaar Bhi Hai<br />
</p>